   "source": [
    "dense_retriever = DenseRetriever(client, \"HotPotQA_dense\")\n",
    "dense_retriever.create_collection()\n",
    "qrels_subset, processed_data = dense_retriever.index_dataset(\n",
    "    dataset.select(range(0, min(subset_size, len(dataset)))), corpus, qrels\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1ef64e80",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Below we run the dense retriver on the ```processed_data``` and evaluate the search results\n",
    "using ```qrels_subset``` as the ground truth search results. The evaluation method\n",
    "was described earlier and is in the ```BaseRetriever``` class."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "49dd9d7e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Dense retriever evaluation scores --------------------\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "{'ndcg@5': np.float64(0.9270356527057372), 'recall@3': np.float64(0.9059196617336153), 'precision@3': np.float64(0.6039464411557434), 'mrr': np.float64(0.9824465586093493)}\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(\"Dense retriever evaluation scores --------------------\")\n",
    "result = dense_retriever.evaluate(qrels_subset, processed_data)\n",
    "print(result)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c862c8b3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
